|term[referent] :status settled :defined-by def-descriptors :anchor reference-act
  :word referent
  :avoid [target result]
  The thing a [[term/reference-act]] intends to pick out.
  |invariants
    - Targeted by one or more [[term/reference-act]]
    - A fetch returns a description-as-of-now of the referent, never the referent itself
